    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Rehydrate with fresh melon! Cantaloupe and other melons have a high water content making them a great snack for the warm months. Cantaloupe is a great source of Vitamin A and C, in fact when you eat one cup serving you reach your daily requirements for these two vitamins!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grown in Hermiston, OR</span></p>",
